This directory contains modifications to sherpa-onnx v1.13.8, commit
11afbd009a7f8c08f4bcf2fc1b265d0df4670fbf.

sherpa-onnx is Copyright the sherpa-onnx contributors and is licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. The modifications are recorded in two patches:

- patches/0001-sherpa-onnx-extended-ort-runtime-v1.13.8.patch adds the
  extended ORT plugin-runtime API, synchronized provider registration and
  device selection, and provider lifetime ownership for keyword spotters.
- patches/0002-sherpa-onnx-keyword-spotter-exception-safety-v1.13.8.patch
  prevents C++ exceptions from crossing the keyword-spotter C entry point.

A copy of the Apache License is available at
../../licenses/SHERPA-ONNX-LICENSE.

The resulting C API DSO statically incorporates checksum-pinned
kaldi-native-fbank, KissFFT, kaldi-decoder, kaldifst/OpenFST,
simple-sentencepiece, Eigen, and nlohmann/json code. Their license and notice
files are retained under ../../licenses/native and copied into release
archives. No Piper or eSpeak library is linked into this TTS-disabled build.
